# Full lean left at 6 m/s on the flat. The lean builds in a quarter second, then the trucks carve
# a circle of minRadius + v^2 / carveAccel: at park speeds board.park's 0.65 + 36/15 = 3.05 m (about
# 1.2 g; it was 1 + 36/9 = 5 m, 0.73 g, before the feel pass's park carve): inside the park grip
# (1.4), so the wheels never slip and the turn keeps its speed (docs/mechanics/board.md). It turns
# about 100 degrees in the second (was 61: heading 90 to 29).
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 0 -12 0.13 90
cmd 6 speed 6
hold left 10..130
run 130
expect max skater.slip < 0.02 over 10..130
expect min skater.slip > -0.02 over 10..130
expect skater.lean < -0.2 at 60
expect skater.heading < 356 at 130
expect skater.heading > 344 at 130
expect skater.speed > 5.7 at 130
expect no event bail
